<!-- Interdisciplinary Studies SBA, Part 1: Causes of Homelessness -->
<Vertical id="homeless_sba_root">

<!--
---
description: Investigate the causes of homelessness using interdisciplinary research methods (part 1 - brainstorm and review community focus group data)
category: interdisciplinary
index: 79
lang: en-Latn-US
---
-->
<Cast cast="characters.cast" id="homeless_sba_demo_part1" title="Interdisciplinary Studies SBA, Part 1 - Causes of Homelessness" launchable="true">
